# The audit, redesign plan, review notes and before/after screenshots used to
# develop this site are not part of the website. They now live at
# D:\personal-site-design-reference\, outside this repository.
#
# That collection also holds captures and extracted measurements of another
# person's public website, which must never be republished from here.
#
# GitHub Pages publishes the whole branch root with no way to exclude a
# subtree, so anything tracked here is served publicly at
# /design-reference/... Keep this repository to the site itself.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
